WEBVTT

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.720
The three separated at a fork in the road.

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:08.150
And now their whereabouts are undisclosed. Do they want to protect themselves, other people,

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.890
or heavenly dreams?

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:12.820
The creases of disorder are a cauldron of three.

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:15.500
To an endless, eternal picture of Hell,

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:19.570
pushing through time a door is dispelled.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:24.860
Your grudge shall be released.

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.220
Have you figured it out?

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:37.970
That’s you.

00:02:13.410 --> 00:02:18.930
This program is made possible by Sony Music, Aniplex,

00:02:19.330 --> 00:02:22.550
and the listed sponsors.

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:45.140
Why do you do this?

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:46.780
Why do you show me this?

00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:49.870
Everything at school’s your doing too, right?

00:02:49.870 --> 00:02:51.370
You do horrible things, don’t you?

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:55.480
Do you want me to become Jigoku Shoujo that badly?

00:02:57.440 --> 00:02:59.140
Say something!

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:00.850
Say something, Enma Ai!

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:13.200
You’ve lost your chance to cast a spell on me, so give up.

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:15.660
I will never become Jigoku Shoujo.

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:17.810
Don’t show up ever again.

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:30.240
I’m home!

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:32.130
Welcome home!

00:03:35.050 --> 00:03:36.900
What is this?

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:38.370
It’s you again, isn’t it?

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:41.740
Oh, Yuzuki, welcome home.

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:44.900
Oh! Father! You’re home!

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:50.310
Oh, hey hey!

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:52.750
Oh, what about the groceries?

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:57.750
Yuzuki, how far did you go shopping?

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:00.110
Oikawa Store.

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:04.960
Let’s see… potatoes, carrots, meat, and green onion!

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:07.300
Oh, you bought that much?

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:08.680
How admirable!

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:10.290
Well then, a reward!

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:13.000
What is it?

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:15.540
Here you go, Yuzuki; it’s for you.

00:04:16.590 --> 00:04:18.780
Oh, what is it?

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:21.090
I wonder… try opening it!

00:04:21.430 --> 00:04:23.840
Oh, I wonder what it is…

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:27.090
Oh! A bear!

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:31.300
A bear! It’s a bear!

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:32.550
It’s a present from your father.

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:35.610
I can’t do too much Pachinko.

00:04:35.610 --> 00:04:37.580
It’s a bit early, but it’s your birthday present.

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:40.060
Your nose is cute, bear!

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:43.550
Yuzuki, how about a thank you to your father?

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:45.850
Oh, father, thank you!

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:48.560
You’re welcome.

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:52.080
Your mother also got something extra!

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:55.570
Oh! Mother, you have a bear, too!

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:57.620
Don’t say it’s something extra!

00:04:57.620 --> 00:04:59.830
Oh, but isn’t it true?

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:01.460
Father!

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:02.440
What?

00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:06.780
Hey, hey! Who taught you?

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:09.440
It’s a secret!

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:10.580
What?

00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:17.050
I remember…

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:20.180
I remember this…

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:35.380
Next stop: South College, South College.

00:05:35.380 --> 00:05:38.350
Those wishing to get off, please press the buzzer near you.

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:52.410
The brakes! They aren’t working!

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:16.120
Hurry and prep for surgery.

00:06:31.230 --> 00:06:33.190
8:19pm.

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:35.550
I’m awfully sorry, but…

00:06:35.550 --> 00:06:36.640
Dear…

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:38.210
Dear…

00:06:38.730 --> 00:06:40.120
Dear!

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:50.030
Father?

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:51.490
Is he here?

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:52.380
No!

00:06:52.100 --> 00:06:53.350
It’s fine, hurry!

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:54.650
My daughter has died!

00:06:54.650 --> 00:06:56.560
Everyone, please stay calm.

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:00.580
Where’s the driver?

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:03.280
What? Has he died, too?

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:07.260
What? If you’re going to die, do so after hearing our complaints!

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:09.460
He has no responsibility whatsoever!

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:12.060
Please, since the situation is like this…

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:14.340
We will listen to what you have to say in the lobby.

00:07:14.340 --> 00:07:15.920
We won’t go anywhere!

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:17.600
I can’t hold it much longer!

00:07:18.340 --> 00:07:19.240
Get out of the way!

00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:20.840
I’ll at least talk to the wife!

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:22.840
You…

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:31.790
Moth-

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:37.230
You idiot!

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:38.210
Yuzuki!

00:07:37.380 --> 00:07:39.220
You idiot! You idiot!

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:41.120
You idiot!

00:07:41.280 --> 00:07:42.660
Yuzuki…

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:42.430
You idiot!

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:47.300
You idiot!!

00:07:55.550 --> 00:08:00.600
We will let you know about the recent accident that occurred.

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:04.230
According to internal investigations, with the vehicle involved in the accident,

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:06.230
there were no verifiable flaws…

00:08:07.610 --> 00:08:09.990
Are you saying it wasn’t inadequate repairs?

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:13.600
But there were some riders saying that the brakes didn’t seem to function!

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:21.080
There were no verifiable flaws, and the accident has been resolved to have been caused artificially.

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:24.390
Are you saying that there were no oversights by Tsujino-bashi Transportation?

00:08:24.390 --> 00:08:29.880
Our company will be giving out compensation to the families of the victims.

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:31.130
That is all.

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:32.370
Oh, hey!

00:08:32.370 --> 00:08:35.370
Then, was it an error on the part of the driver?

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:38.060
Was there a problem with the driver?

00:08:38.060 --> 00:08:39.380
Please answer!

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:42.390
It’s fine like this.

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:45.330
Then, I’m sorry, but I’ll leave the rest up to you.

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:47.540
Yes, President.

00:09:04.650 --> 00:09:05.900
Mother…

00:09:07.490 --> 00:09:08.880
Are you hungry?

00:09:09.760 --> 00:09:12.000
Should I make something for you?

00:09:13.770 --> 00:09:16.220
I’m going to the Oikawa Store, OK?

00:09:35.980 --> 00:09:38.450
Don’t you want them to leave?

00:09:48.510 --> 00:09:49.850
Aren’t I right?

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:51.370
I guess…

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:53.710
Good afternoon!

00:09:53.710 --> 00:09:56.140
Oh, welcome, Yuzuki-chan!

00:09:56.140 --> 00:09:57.690
How’s your mother?

00:09:57.690 --> 00:09:58.820
She’s sleeping.

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:00.920
I see… how worrisome.

00:10:06.190 --> 00:10:07.710
What would you like today?

00:10:08.300 --> 00:10:09.720
Bread and eggs!

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:12.470
Oh, bread and eggs again?

00:10:12.470 --> 00:10:16.820
OK! I’ll teach you a tasty meal even a child can make!

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:18.230
What? Really?

00:10:18.230 --> 00:10:20.730
Oh… let’s see…

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:22.940
Oh, Sayo-chan!

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:25.330
Mother!

00:10:28.920 --> 00:10:30.700
Satoshi-kun,

00:10:31.070 --> 00:10:32.420
please!

00:10:32.950 --> 00:10:33.940
What?

00:10:44.840 --> 00:10:46.420
Morning!

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:49.950
I haven’t done my homework this week!

00:10:50.930 --> 00:10:53.140
Morning!

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:56.140
She’s here…

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:57.720
She’s here…

00:10:58.140 --> 00:11:00.720
My mother told me not to look.

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:03.040
I was also told not to speak to her…

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:04.160
Why?

00:11:19.250 --> 00:11:21.610
Oh, that’s fine, since it’s heavy.

00:11:21.620 --> 00:11:23.320
I’ll do it later.

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:26.130
First, can you order the shelves’ goods nicely?

00:11:26.130 --> 00:11:28.130
I’m sorry, Satoshi-kun.

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:30.850
It’s fine! Isn’t your body still tired?

00:11:30.850 --> 00:11:32.640
Don’t try too hard.

00:11:35.350 --> 00:11:37.550
Why are you smiling so much?

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:39.480
I’m not really.

00:11:39.480 --> 00:11:41.760
We’re at the limit, just with the two of us!

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:43.410
But still hiring a part-timer…

00:11:43.410 --> 00:11:44.940
And especially that woman!

00:11:44.940 --> 00:11:47.890
Don’t say stuff like that, since she’s in trouble!

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:50.510
They say she was offered money from Tsujino-bashi-san.

00:11:50.510 --> 00:11:52.140
They say she refused it.

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:53.740
Refused?

00:11:53.740 --> 00:11:56.050
Well, it was the driver’s error…

00:11:56.050 --> 00:11:57.300
Is she an idiot?

00:11:57.300 --> 00:11:58.870
Hey, she can hear you!

00:11:58.870 --> 00:12:03.010
Hey you, it’s really because you’re childhood friends with her, right?

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:04.220
What?

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:06.170
It’s been a rumor around town.

00:12:06.170 --> 00:12:07.880
Think about my position as well!

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:09.380
What are you saying?

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:14.490
If you hire a sickly woman who doesn’t work much, it’s a no-brainer that rumors will spread!

00:12:14.490 --> 00:12:16.790
I have no idea. Forget about those kind of things!

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:17.940
You’re an idiot!

00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:19.880
We’re a trade service!

00:12:24.020 --> 00:12:30.600
Uh… uncle? I’m sorry it’s so sudden, but my daughter and I…

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:34.750
What? Oh, yes. Yes.

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:37.910
I see. I understand.

00:12:44.840 --> 00:12:47.500
Oh, good evening! This is Sayako.

00:12:48.270 --> 00:12:49.930
It’s been a while.

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:57.290
I see…

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:59.990
Yes, I understand.

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:06.360
Mother…

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:09.690
Did the bath feel good?

00:13:10.780 --> 00:13:11.930
Are you OK?

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:14.570
I’m OK.

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:20.940
What a nice smell.

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:23.430
Mother.

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:25.870
Yuzuki.

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:35.050
Thank you as always.

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:39.640
Sayo-chan!

00:13:39.640 --> 00:13:40.920
Are you OK?

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:41.980
A cold?

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:44.180
Oh… maybe…

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:47.260
Sayo-chan.

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:48.130
Stop…

00:13:48.130 --> 00:13:50.350
For awhile now I’ve… about you…

00:13:50.870 --> 00:13:52.100
Uh…

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:16.090
Do you want to drink some water?

00:14:16.400 --> 00:14:17.690
Thank you.

00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:19.060
Does it hurt?

00:14:19.360 --> 00:14:20.620
I’m OK.

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:25.190
Yuzuki…

00:14:26.450 --> 00:14:29.450
Don’t go to the Oikawa Store any more…

00:14:29.850 --> 00:14:30.830
Why?

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:34.490
Your mother quit.

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:36.510
I see…

00:14:36.990 --> 00:14:38.800
Then, I’ll work!

00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:40.950
So you can sleep, mother!

00:14:42.510 --> 00:14:44.300
Thank you, Yuzuki.

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:48.300
I’ll go to the doctor tomorrow and get checked up.

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:49.270
Really?

00:14:49.890 --> 00:14:51.930
Yes, really.

00:14:52.430 --> 00:14:54.900
Then it’ll get better soon.

00:14:56.090 --> 00:14:58.590
I’m sorry, but can you go somewhere else?

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:02.340
What is she doing, that woman?

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:04.680
What is she doing?

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:17.910
Mother, that’s a hospital, too.

00:15:17.910 --> 00:15:18.960
We can’t go there.

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:20.820
Why?

00:15:21.550 --> 00:15:22.480
Let’s go home.

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:23.870
Let’s go home.

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:36.920
I’m home!

00:15:36.920 --> 00:15:38.310
Mother?

00:15:38.710 --> 00:15:40.370
Mother?

00:15:41.280 --> 00:15:42.400
Mother?

00:15:43.780 --> 00:15:47.280
Help! Help! My mother is…

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:49.740
Help! My mother is…

00:15:49.740 --> 00:15:51.860
Someone, someone!

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:55.560
My mother is… My mother is…

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:56.240
Is she feeling sick?

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:58.440
Why not take her to the hospital?

00:16:00.010 --> 00:16:02.540
Help! Help!

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:02.520
Is that OK?

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:05.250
Children’s troubles are negligible.

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:07.580
Making such a big fuss… It’s probably just a cold or something.

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:09.180
Ojichan!

00:16:09.790 --> 00:16:11.400
My mother is… My mother…!

00:16:11.830 --> 00:16:13.250
Don’t come near me anymore!

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:14.060
Ojichan?

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:15.700
Ojichan!

00:16:16.400 --> 00:16:19.500
Ojichan… Ojichan…

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:36.680
Since you need another stamp here…

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:38.820
Unless you turn in the forms…

00:16:38.820 --> 00:16:42.320
For that, you need to prove your income…

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:51.040
What are you doing?

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:57.840
Here, take this!

00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:12.600
Yuzuki,

00:17:14.270 --> 00:17:15.710
what day is it?

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:17.400
I don’t know.

00:17:17.810 --> 00:17:19.840
What happened to school?

00:17:20.770 --> 00:17:22.190
I won’t go anymore,

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:24.730
since I get bullied.

00:17:26.910 --> 00:17:28.410
Have you eaten something?

00:17:29.470 --> 00:17:30.940
I haven’t.

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:33.530
You have to eat something!

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:37.210
It’s fine.

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:42.080
Yuzuki…

00:17:44.610 --> 00:17:45.870
Let’s go.

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:09.700
Yuzuki,

00:18:10.260 --> 00:18:11.470
I’m sorry.

00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:19.930
What? It’s here? It’s all worn out!

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:22.620
That’s why it’s good! Since there are few worshippers,

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:24.840
wouldn’t they answer your prayers for sure?

00:18:24.840 --> 00:18:26.180
What are you talking about?

00:18:28.990 --> 00:18:30.770
I beg of you, god…

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:33.590
That Oomori-kun would kiss me.

00:18:34.360 --> 00:18:36.100
What? What are you trying to say?

00:18:36.100 --> 00:18:37.090
Aren’t I right?

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:39.210
No, not at all!

00:18:39.820 --> 00:18:42.070
You!

00:18:42.070 --> 00:18:43.120
Why are you saying that?

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:55.120
Mother, are you OK?

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:58.320
I’ll sleep a bit.

00:18:58.870 --> 00:19:00.060
Sure.

00:19:08.780 --> 00:19:10.170
Mother?

00:19:10.970 --> 00:19:14.290
Mother? Mother…?

00:19:14.720 --> 00:19:16.150
Mother!

00:19:18.030 --> 00:19:19.580
Mother…

00:20:29.860 --> 00:20:31.460
I remember now…

00:20:38.850 --> 00:20:39.990
Yuzuki…

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:41.850
Yuzuki…

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:44.850
Akie…

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:53.360
Akie?

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:28.310
I’ve finally realized that there should be a Jigoku Shoujo…

00:21:29.420 --> 00:21:31.270
And that she’s absolutely necessary.

00:21:31.610 --> 00:21:33.110
I will accept my fate.

00:21:37.090 --> 00:21:44.000
I, who was abandoned by the world, will become Ai…

00:21:45.230 --> 00:21:47.130
And purify this world.

00:21:48.470 --> 00:21:49.880
Purify?

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:53.630
Akie, I’ll make a promise.

00:21:53.630 --> 00:21:56.930
I won’t ever send someone who’s sinless like you to Hell.

00:21:57.890 --> 00:22:01.160
That girl’s soul has fallen to Hell.

00:22:01.160 --> 00:22:03.090
She, right now, is just a guide.

00:22:05.960 --> 00:22:08.270
Your master has disappeared.

00:22:08.900 --> 00:22:11.450
You’ll help me from now on, right?

00:22:26.170 --> 00:22:27.510
Thank you.

00:22:46.500 --> 00:22:47.760
It’s a job.

00:24:20.590 --> 00:24:22.440
I am Jigoku Shoujo.

00:24:22.760 --> 00:24:27.780
I finally realized that there are some in this world that should be judged.

00:24:28.180 --> 00:24:32.670
But that’s not something for you to decide.

00:24:32.670 --> 00:24:35.600
Breaking the rules is not allowed.

00:24:35.600 --> 00:24:38.120
That’s Jigoku Shoujo.

00:24:38.120 --> 00:24:40.350
I’m different from Ai.

00:24:40.350 --> 00:24:43.920
You don’t know the truth yet.

00:24:44.780 --> 00:24:48.290
Last Episode: Tracks of the Soul.

00:24:50.710 --> 00:24:55.880
This program is made possible by Sony Music, Aniplex,

00:24:55.880 --> 00:24:58.990
and the listed sponsors.
